#: usr/bin/cinnamon-remove-application:33 usr/bin/mint-remove-application:33
msgid ""
"This menu item is not associated to any package. Do you want to remove it "
"from the menu anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie kieslysitem is nie aan enige pakkie gekoppel nie. Wil jy dit in elk "
"geval van die kieslys verwyder?"

#: usr/bin/cinnamon-remove-application:78 usr/bin/mint-remove-application:78
msgid "The following packages will be removed:"
msgstr "Die volgende pakkies gaan verwyder word:"

#: usr/bin/cinnamon-remove-application:85 usr/bin/mint-remove-application:85
msgid "Packages to be removed"
msgstr "Pakette om te verwyder"

#: usr/bin/cinnamon-remove-application:146 usr/bin/mint-remove-application:146
#, python-format
msgid "Cannot remove package %s as it is required by a system package."
msgstr ""
"Kan nie pakkie %s verwyder nie aangesien dit deur 'n stelselpakkie vereis "
"word."

#: usr/bin/cinnamon-remove-application:152 usr/bin/mint-remove-application:152
